                        <locus target="#1r">-1r</locus>والعاديات ذبحا فالموريات قدحا والمغيات صبحا</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#162v">-162v</locus>يارهم لاول الحشر ما ظننتم ان يخرجوا وظنوا انهم</explicit>
                     <note>The folios are bound in a mixed up order. Fol. 1r begins with verse 100:1. Fol. 3v begins with verse 18:75, i.e. the beginning of ǧuz’ 16. On fol. 3r a fragment of a du‘ā’ before the beginning of Qur’ān. Different hands. Fol. 2 bound upside down. Ṯumn markers. Words divided into two lines. Vocalized.</note>
